### 1. Add User
POST http://localhost:3000/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User 1",
  "age": 27,
  "email": "user@email.com"
}

### 2. Add User (Duplicate Email Test)
POST http://localhost:3000/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User 2",
  "age": 30,
  "email": "user@email.com"
}

### 3. Get All Users
GET http://localhost:3000/user

### 4. Get User By ID
GET http://localhost:3000/user/1

### 5. Get User By ID (Not Found Test)
GET http://localhost:3000/user/99

